Community participation as referred to in paragraph (1) shall be carried out by individuals, Desa Pakraman, social community institutions, non-governmental organizations, educational institutions, religious institutions, the private sector, and mass media.
Pakraman Village is a customary law community unit in Bali Province that has a unified tradition and etiquette of social life of the Hindu community passed down through generations within the bond of Kahyangan Tiga or Kahyangan Desa which has a certain territory and its own assets and has the right to manage its own household;

